<title>GREECE: FUND MANAGER KOKOVIDIS MOVES TO ALPHA BROKERAGE.</title>
<headline>FUND MANAGER KOKOVIDIS MOVES TO ALPHA BROKERAGE.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Costas Kokovidis, former fund manager of Xiosbank fixed income mutual fund, has gone to Alpha brokerage, market sources said.</p>
<p>Kokovidis will work as portfolio manager at the asset management department of Alpha Brokerage. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
